<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-118.1-revenue-assurance-strategy-governance-and-leak-detection-framework" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3689" name="W3689. Revenue Assurance Program Strategy &amp; Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual finance planning (links to VS-33.1/VS-17.4); program review
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Enterprise revenue-assurance program
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Finance
Participants: Revenue Assurance Lead, Finance (links to VS-17), FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4), Treasury (links to VS-18), POS/IT (links to VS-08/VS-27), Internal Audit (links to VS-21.3), Loss Prevention (links to VS-23), Ecommerce (links to VS-10), Loyalty/Gift Card (links to VS-13/VS-54), Promotions (links to VS-58), Payments (links to VS-80), Cross-Entity (links to VS-72)
Source: workflow W3689 — Revenue Assurance Program Strategy &amp; Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3689_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3689_Lane1" name="Revenue Assurance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3689_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3689_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3689_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3689_Lane2" name="CFO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3689_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3689_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3689_Start4" name="Annual finance planning (links to VS-33.1/VS-17.4); program review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3689_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3689_Task5" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Finance define the revenue-assurance program strategy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Revenue Assurance Lead/Finance define the revenue-assurance program strategy and governance: scope (all revenue channels and waterfalls — POS, ecommerce, B2B/AR, marketplace/3P, retail media, loyalty/gift-card, services), the leakage taxonomy (W3690), the operating model (continuous monitoring + periodic audit), and the KPIs (leakage rate by channel, recovery rate, control-effectiveness, exception-cycle-time)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3689_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3689_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3689_Task6" name="Revenue Assurance Lead establish the governance: Revenue Assurance Lead…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Revenue Assurance Lead establish the governance: Revenue Assurance Lead authority, the cross-functional responsibilities (Finance owns the program, IT/POS enables tooling, Loss Prevention investigates fraud, Audit independently verifies), the revenue-assurance policy, and the integration to FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), treasury (VS-18), audit (VS-21.3), and loss prevention (VS-23)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Finance / Audit
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3689_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3689_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3689_Task7" name="CFO ratify the revenue-assurance strategy and policy, approve the program…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CFO ratify the revenue-assurance strategy and policy, approve the program budget (links to VS-17.4), set the leakage-reduction target, and report revenue-assurance posture and leakage exposure to the executive risk committee (links to VS-21.2/VS-36) and board (links to VS-36); communicate the mandate
Responsible (R): CFO / Revenue Assurance Lead
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3689_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3689_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3689_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3689_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3689_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-108 (ensure revenue leakage detection &amp; recovery.) | - operational: Revenue Assurance Lead authority and continuous model; operational: leakage taxonomy (W3690)
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Finance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3689_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3689_Annotation9" targetRef="W3689_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3689_Flow11" sourceRef="W3689_Start4" targetRef="W3689_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3689_Flow12" sourceRef="W3689_Task5" targetRef="W3689_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3689_Flow13" sourceRef="W3689_Task6" targetRef="W3689_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3689_Flow14" sourceRef="W3689_Task7" targetRef="W3689_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3689_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3689_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3689">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3689_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3689_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3689_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W3689_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
