      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Taxonomy mapping (W3690); control design; exception event
Frequency: Maintained + continuous
Volume: Enterprise RA controls and exception queue
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Finance
Participants: Revenue Assurance Lead, Finance (links to VS-17), POS/IT (links to VS-08/VS-27), Loss Prevention (links to VS-23), Audit (links to VS-21.3), BI (links to VS-28.1), Internal Controls (links to internal-controls-matrix)
Source: workflow W3693 — Revenue Assurance Controls &amp; Exception Monitoring Framework</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3693_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3693_Lane1" name="Revenue Assurance Lead">
