      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3693_Start3" name="Taxonomy mapping (W3690); control design; exception event">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3693_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3693_Task4" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Finance design and maintain the revenue-assurance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Revenue Assurance Lead/Finance design and maintain the revenue-assurance controls framework: preventive controls (system validations, price-lock, discount-stacking limits), detective controls (exception reports, threshold alerts, reconciliation), and corrective controls (recovery W3706); map each control to a leakage vector (W3690) and register in the internal-controls matrix
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Finance / Internal Controls
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3693_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3693_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3693_Task5" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/BI operate continuous exception monitoring: run…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Revenue Assurance Lead/BI operate continuous exception monitoring: run exception-based reporting across pricing overrides, manual price changes, promo/loyalty/gift-card anomalies, refund/reversal spikes, catch-weight outliers, VAT/discount exceptions, and settlement variances; route exceptions to investigation (links to W3705/W3708)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / BI
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3693_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3693_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3693_Task6" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Audit monitor control effectiveness: track…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Revenue Assurance Lead/Audit monitor control effectiveness: track control-firing rate, exception-resolution cycle-time, false-positive rate, and control-failure incidents; report control posture to audit (links to VS-21.3) and governance (links to W3689), and remediate ineffective controls
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Audit
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3693_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3693_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3693_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3693_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
