    <bpmn:process id="W_W3694" name="W3694. Multi-Channel Revenue Consolidation &amp; Reconciliation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Daily/monthly close; channel settlement
Frequency: Daily + monthly
Volume: POS + ecommerce + B2B/AR + marketplace/3P + retail media + services
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Finance
Participants: Revenue Assurance Lead, Finance (links to VS-17.1/VS-17.4), Ecommerce (links to VS-10), Marketplace (links to VS-95/VS-65), Retail Media (links to VS-48), AR (links to VS-16), Treasury (links to VS-18), BI (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3694 — Multi-Channel Revenue Consolidation &amp; Reconciliation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3694_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3694_Lane1" name="Revenue Assurance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3694_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3694_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3694_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3694_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3694_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3694_Start3" name="Daily/monthly close; channel settlement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3694_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3694_Task4" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Finance consolidate revenue across all channels into a…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Revenue Assurance Lead/Finance consolidate revenue across all channels into a single reconciliation: in-store POS, ecommerce (BOPIS + delivery), B2B/AR billing, marketplace operator commission/fee, retail-media advertising, gift-card breakage, and services; reconcile each channel&#x27;s gross-to-net to the GL (links to VS-17.1)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Finance / BI
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Daily + monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3694_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3694_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3694_Task5" name="Revenue Assurance Lead reconcile channel-specific settlement: ecommerce…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Revenue Assurance Lead reconcile channel-specific settlement: ecommerce payment-gateway settlement (links to VS-80), marketplace 3P-seller commission and payout (links to VS-95.3), retail-media billing (links to VS-48.3), and intercompany digital-commerce fees (links to VS-72); identify cross-channel leakage
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Ecommerce / Marketplace / Retail Media
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3694_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3694_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3694_Task6" name="Revenue Assurance Lead publish the consolidated multi-channel revenue…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Revenue Assurance Lead publish the consolidated multi-channel revenue reconciliation and any residual variance to month-end close (links to VS-17.1) and FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4), ensuring reported group revenue is complete and accurate across all channels and entities
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Finance
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3694_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3694_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3694_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3694_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
