        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-108 (ensure revenue leakage detection &amp; recovery.) | - operational: full-channel consolidation; operational: timing-aware reconciliation
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Finance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
