    <bpmn:process id="W_W3695" name="W3695. Revenue Assurance Policy, Authority &amp; Approval Matrix" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program strategy (W3689); governance cycle; policy change
Frequency: Maintained + on change
Volume: RA policy and authorities
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / CFO
Participants: Revenue Assurance Lead, CFO, Finance (links to VS-17), POS/IT (links to VS-08/VS-27), Audit (links to VS-21), Loss Prevention (links to VS-23), CEO, Board (links to VS-36)
Source: workflow W3695 — Revenue Assurance Policy, Authority &amp; Approval Matrix</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3695_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3695_Lane1" name="Revenue Assurance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3695_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3695_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3695_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
