      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3695_Start3" name="Program strategy (W3689); governance cycle; policy change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3695_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3695_Task4" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/CFO maintain the revenue-assurance policy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Revenue Assurance Lead/CFO maintain the revenue-assurance policy: pricing-change governance, discount/override authority, promo/loyalty/gift-card integrity rules, refund/reversal authority, settlement-reconciliation standards, and the leakage-escalation threshold
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / CFO
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3695_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3695_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3695_Task5" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/CFO maintain the approval-authority matrix for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Revenue Assurance Lead/CFO maintain the approval-authority matrix for revenue-impacting actions (price overrides, manual discounts, refund/value adjustments, write-offs of leakage) by value (Cashier → Supervisor → Store Manager → Finance → CFO per links to VS-36), aligned to the internal-controls matrix and board-delegated authorities
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / CFO
Accountable (A): CEO / Board
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3695_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3695_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3695_Task6" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Audit enforce the policy and authority: gate high-risk…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Revenue Assurance Lead/Audit enforce the policy and authority: gate high-risk revenue actions on approval, audit conformance, manage breaches, and report policy/authority effectiveness to governance (links to W3689) and audit (links to VS-21)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Audit
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3695_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3695_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3695_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3695_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3695_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-108 (ensure revenue leakage detection &amp; recovery.) | - operational: system gating and audit; operational: annual review
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / CFO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
