    <bpmn:process id="W_W3696" name="W3696. Revenue Assurance Audit, Documentation &amp; Records" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual audit cycle; regulatory inspection; loss event
Frequency: Annual + on event
Volume: Program documentation and records
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Audit
Participants: Revenue Assurance Lead, Audit (links to VS-21.3), Finance (links to VS-17), Records (links to VS-88), Compliance (links to VS-22), Cross-Entity (links to VS-72)
Source: workflow W3696 — Revenue Assurance Audit, Documentation &amp; Records</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3696_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3696_Lane1" name="Revenue Assurance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3696_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3696_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3696_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3696_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3696_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3696_Start3" name="Annual audit cycle; regulatory inspection; loss event">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3696_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3696_Task4" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Records maintain the revenue-assurance documentation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Revenue Assurance Lead/Records maintain the revenue-assurance documentation: leakage taxonomy (W3690), controls register (W3693), reconciliations (W3691/W3694), exception-investigation records (W3705), recovery records (W3706), and the monthly W348 audit; retention per VS-88 and regulation
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Records
Accountable (A): Revenue Assurance Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3696_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3696_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3696_Task5" name="Revenue Assurance Lead/Audit conduct the annual revenue-assurance audit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Revenue Assurance Lead/Audit conduct the annual revenue-assurance audit (extending W348): reconciliation integrity (W3691), control effectiveness (W3693), channel coverage (W3694), policy/authority conformance (W3695), leakage-recovery completeness (W3706), and reported-revenue accuracy; internal and (where required) external
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Audit
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3696_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3696_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3696_Task6" name="Revenue Assurance Lead manage findings to closure, support external audit and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Revenue Assurance Lead manage findings to closure, support external audit and BIR/SEC revenue-reporting defense (links to VS-22/VS-79), and report audit posture to the audit committee (links to VS-21/VS-36) and governance (links to W3689)
Responsible (R): Revenue Assurance Lead / Audit / Compliance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3696_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3696_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3696_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3696_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3696_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-583 (ensure controlled execution — Revenue Assurance Strategy, Governance &amp; Leak Detection Framework (PA-118.1).) | - operational: documentation discipline; operational: comprehensive annual audit
Owner: Revenue Assurance Lead / Audit</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
